# Code ownership for unifi-extract
#
# Sole maintainer: this file documents ownership and satisfies the OpenSSF
# Scorecard Branch-Protection check that looks for a CODEOWNERS file. It is
# NOT a hard self-review gate — GitHub blocks self-approval, so do not enable
# "require review from Code Owners" against the maintainer's own PRs (or keep
# admin bypass). Scope is intentionally limited to Go code and CI/config.

